**Verdict:** 1ct marquise is the honest "one carat engagement ring" at a 27% premium over round and a 38% discount vs 1.25ct marquise. Buy here if "1 carat" is the symbolic goal. Full shape math in our [round diamond vs marquise](/round-diamond-vs-marquise) guide and the [marquise cut diamond size chart](/marquise-cut-diamond-size-chart).

